2.
In these regulations, unless the context otherwise requires :-
(a)
"Act" means the Madhya Pradesh Khadi Tatha Gramodyog Adhiniyam, 1978 (No. 16 of 1978);
Page 1/4

M.P. Khadi Tatha Gramodyog Regulations, 1980
(b)
"Board" means the Madhya Pradesh Khadi Tatha Gramodyog Board;
(c)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Board;
(d)
"District Committee" means a District Committee constituted under sub-section (1) of Section 12-A;
(e)
"Section" means a section of the Act;
(f)
"Member" means a member of the Board.
